From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: stephanofer <slowdown_4@hotmail.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: validate movement from inside blocks

Plugin-placed blocks can enclose a player, disabling vanilla movement
correction and the clear-to-clear phase check. Validate the swept player
volume against new obstacles and reject deepening existing partial overlaps.
Allow escape and vanilla axis-ordered step-up movement. Bound exceptional
scans and refuse unloaded chunks without changing plugin teleports.

